= Connecting a Person to a Team with a Note
Persons in Teams can now be connected with Notes to be shown while onboarding in the correct team. To correctly connect a person with a note, the note has to be added to the corresponding month column when the person should be shown in the team. For example, if a person should be shown in the team in the month of June, the note has to be added to the June column. It is important to use the Notes instead of the comments in excel. The Notes can be added by right-clicking on the cell and selecting "Insert Note". 

